# [RTGAREA](../wg/rtgarea.html)

## Summary

The Routing Area (RTGAREA) working group met to discuss YANG module versioning practices for module authors and to review real-world measurement findings regarding Route Origin Validation (ROV) and Autonomous System Provider Authorization (ASPA) enforcement on production routers. Due to initial remote audio connectivity issues, the presentation order was adjusted to accommodate the speakers.

## Key Discussion Points

### Session Introduction & Chair Updates
* **Slides**: [RTGAREA Chair Slides](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-rtgarea-rtgarea-chair-slides-00)
